### API key rotation — the silent bottleneck

Current state: All pipelines fall back to `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` (generic) because per-pipeline keys use `${OPENROUTER_KEY_STANDARD:-${OPENROUTER_API_KEY}}` fallback in docker-compose. If pipeline-specific key is unset or empty, everyone shares 20 req/min.

Fix: Remove the generic fallback. Force each pipeline to use its own key. Total capacity goes from 20 req/min to 120 req/min.

